      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "10",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cheliliyi Ezera iku wudi nakulomba, nakwitŋia mwaIuwiluwu, nakudila, nakudinatola hamaseki kumesu etala daNzambi, kudi yena hikukupompa izaza dadeni nankashi dawantu amuIsarela, ni amayala, niambanda, niatwansi; muloŋa antu adiŋi nakudila makumbu aweni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwana kaYehiyeli Shekaniya, wakudi anyana kaElami, hakuhosha naEzera, hakumwila nindi, Tunaputi dehi muloŋa kudi Nzambi yetu, tunasumbuli dehi ambanda amwacheŋi amunyuza yamwituŋa; hela chochu, hansaŋu iyi hadi hakukuhwelela aIsarela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi dinu tutiyaŋanenu chitiyaŋenu naNzambi yetu, tuhaŋi aŋodi jetu ejima ni anyanawu anavwaluwu, mwomwaya maana anatulejiyi nkaka, nianatulejuwu azaalaŋa woma wakuleja kwaNzambi yetu; akelumu nawa mwomwaya nshimbi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyamukaku muloŋa nsaŋu iyi yidi kudeyi, ninetu tudi hamu naneyi, umikaku, wilumu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ezera hakunyamuka, hakuyisanyikisha awakulumpi awatupristu nawaLevi, niaIsarela ejima, nawu, Tukwila mwaya izu idi. Asanyika nikusanyika.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ezera hakunyamuka kumesu etala daNzambi kwadiŋiyi, hakwijila mwitala damwana kaEliyashibi Yehohanani damukachi; chashikiliyi mwenomu hadiili yakudya hela kunwa mejuku; nanochu chadiŋiyi nakudila muloŋa wanawa ayili muwuduŋu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiyakuyibidikisha ejima ayili muwuduŋu mwahita Yuda naYerusalema, nawu, Pompenu kuYerusalema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawu, Yowu wukubula kwinza mumafuku asatu, mwaya mpùŋa yinakwati atulamba nawawakulumpi, akamutambula yuma yindi yejima, niyomwenindi akumufumisha muchipompelu chanawa ayili muwuduŋu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amayala ejima amuYuda naBenjamini apompeli mumafuku asatu. Wadiŋi kakweji kamuchitanu nachiwana, hefuku dakakweji damakumi ayedi. Antu ejima ashakamini mulubanza lwakumesu etala daNzambi nakuzaala woma wansaŋu iyi niwanvula yeneni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kapristu Ezera hakwimana, hakuyila nindi, Munatanyi dehi, munasuinbuli ambanda amwacheŋi kulonda mutoheshi kutanya kwaIsarela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ichi dinu itŋienu kudi Yehova Nzambi yawankakulula jenu, mwili mwaya muchima windi. Dambulenu munyuza yamwituŋa nikudi ambanda amwacheŋi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chipompelu chejima hichikumwakula, hiyakwila nezu deneni nawu, Chachiwahi. Chidi kudetu kwila mwaya izu deyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa ntu amavulu, ninvula yinasweji, hitunatweshi kwimana hanzuku, nimudimu iwu hiwefuku dimu hela wamafuku ayeduku, muloŋa tunasweji nankashi kuputola muloŋiwu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ichi dinu mwani, akunjikuku awakulumpi achipompelu chejima, niadi munyikala yetu ejima anasumbuli ambanda amwacheŋi, akenzi hakayishiikashiikawu hamu nawawakulumpi amunyikala yawu, niansompeshi jawu, hamukala hamukala, nichakafumishawu kuzuwa kwaNzambi yetu kunasweji, nichakamanishawu nsaŋu iyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AJonatani mwana kaAsaheli, naYahazeya mwana kaTikiva, diwu hohu adikaŋili kunsaŋu iyi. AMeshulami nakaLevi Shabetayi diwu ayikwashiluku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayili muwuduŋu hiyakwila mwenomu. Kapristu Ezera nawawakulumpi amakwawu akumavumu awankakulula jawu, mwahita mavumu awankakulula jawu, ayambwiluku hejina hejina wejima wawu. Hefuku dakusambila dakakweji wekumi hiyakushakama nakushinshika nsaŋu iyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hefuku dakusambila dakakweji wakusambila, dihu hamanishiluwu nsaŋu jawamayala ejima asumbwili ambanda amwacheŋi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akudi anyana kawatupristu amwenuwu, asumbwili ambanda amwacheŋi, diwu aMaseya, naEliyezeri, naYaribi, naGedaIiya, akudi anyana kaYeshuwa mwana kaYozadaki, niakudi ana kwindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiyakwolola chikasa nawu, Tukuhaŋa aŋodi jetu. Cheliluwu anatanyi dehi, hiyakulambula chizamba chamwiyinda nakutanya kwawu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akudi anyana kaImeri, Hanani naZebadiya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akudi anyana kaHarimi, Mayaseya, naElija, naShemaya, naYehiyeli, naUziya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akudi anyana kaPashuri, Eliyowenayi, Mayaseya, Ishimeli, Netaneli, Yozabadi, niElasa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akudi aLevi, Yozabadi, naShimeyi, naKelaya diyi Kelita, niPetahiya, niYuda, niEliyezeri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.23",
